      <p class="deprecated-text"><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>Deprecated:  Use '[]', 'tonumber', and 'math.modf' instead.</span></p>
      <p>  <p>Returns an integer that is at <b>index</b> in <b>src</b>.</p>
</p>
